#: includes/trait-ifi-i18n.php:224
msgid "Honeypot"
msgstr "蜜罐"

#: includes/trait-ifi-i18n.php:183
msgid "A field real visitors never see. Submissions that fill it are bots."
msgstr "正常访客看不到的字段；填了它的都是机器人。"

#: includes/trait-ifi-i18n.php:184
msgid "Enable the honeypot"
